       kkiillllaallll55 is the SystemV kkiillllaallll command. It sends a signal to all  pro‐
       cesses  except  kernel threads and the processes in its own session, so
       it won't kill the shell that is running the script it was called  from.
       Its  primary  (only)  use is in the rrcc scripts found in the _/_e_t_c_/_i_n_i_t_._d
       directory.

